{"page":552,"verses":[{"verse_key":"61:6","surah":61,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ عِيسَى ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ يَـٰبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ إِنِّى رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ إِلَيْكُم مُّصَدِّقًا لِّمَا بَيْنَ يَدَىَّ مِنَ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ وَمُبَشِّرًۢا بِرَسُولٍ يَأْتِى مِنۢ بَعْدِى ٱسْمُهُۥٓ أَحْمَدُ ۖ فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ قَالُوا۟ هَـٰذَا سِحْرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Jesus, son of Mary, said, ‘Children of Israel, I am sent to you by God, confirming the Torah that came before me and bringing good news of a messenger to follow me whose name will be Ahmad.’ Yet when he came to them with clear signs, they said, ‘This is obviously sorcery.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"ʿīsā","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱبْنُ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ub'nu","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I am","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَسُولُ","en_gloss":"(the) Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlu","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّصَدِّقًۭا","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِّمَا","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"61:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(was) between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"61:6"},{"