 wrong than someone who invents lies against God when called to submit to Him? God does not guide the wrongdoers:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more wrong","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّنِ","en_gloss":"than (one) who","transliteration":"mimmani","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"invents","transliteration":"if'tarā","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","en_gloss":"the lie","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُدْعَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"is invited","transliteration":"yud'ʿā","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْإِسْلَـٰمِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Islam","transliteration":"l-is'lāmi","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"[the] wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"61:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"61:7"}]},{"verse_key":"61:8","surah":61,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ لِيُطْفِـُٔوا۟ نُورَ ٱللَّهِ بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَٱللَّهُ مُتِمُّ نُورِهِۦ وَلَوْ كَرِهَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they wish to put His light out with their mouths. But He will perfect His light, even though the disbelievers hate it;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"They intend","transliteration":"yurīdūna","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِيُطْفِـُٔوا۟","en_gloss":"to put out","transliteration":"liyuṭ'fiū","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نُورَ","en_gloss":"(the) light","transliteration":"nūra","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their mouths","transliteration":"bi-afwāhihim","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"but Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُتِمُّ","en_gloss":"will perfect","transliteration":"mutimmu","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُورِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Light","transliteration":"nūrihi","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"although","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَرِهَ","en_gloss":"dislike","transliteration":"kariha","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirūna","verse_key":"61:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"61:8"}]},{"verse_key":"61:9","surah":61,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَرْسَلَ رَسُولَهُۥ بِٱلْهُدَىٰ وَدِينِ ٱلْحَقِّ لِيُظْهِرَهُۥ عَلَى ٱلدِّينِ كُلِّهِۦ وَلَوْ كَرِهَ ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is He who sent His Messenger with guidance and the religion of truth to show that it is above all [other] religions, even though the idolaters hate it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"61:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"61:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْسَلَ","en_gloss":"sent","transliteration":"arsala","verse_key":"61:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlahu","verse_key":"61:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱل