":14,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ كُونُوٓا۟ أَنصَارَ ٱللَّهِ كَمَا قَالَ عِيسَى ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ لِلْحَوَارِيِّـۧنَ مَنْ أَنصَارِىٓ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ ۖ قَالَ ٱلْحَوَارِيُّونَ نَحْنُ أَنصَارُ ٱللَّهِ ۖ فَـَٔامَنَت طَّآئِفَةٌ مِّنۢ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ وَكَفَرَت طَّآئِفَةٌ ۖ فَأَيَّدْنَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ عَلَىٰ عَدُوِّهِمْ فَأَصْبَحُوا۟ ظَـٰهِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, be God’s helpers. As Jesus, son of Mary, said to the disciples, ‘Who will come with me to help God?’ The disciples said, ‘We shall be God’s helpers.’ Some of the Children of Israel believed and some disbelieved: We supported the believers against their enemy and they were the ones who came out on top.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُونُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Be","transliteration":"kūnū","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنصَارَ","en_gloss":"helpers","transliteration":"anṣāra","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"ʿīsā","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱبْنُ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ub'nu","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِلْحَوَارِيِّـۧنَ","en_gloss":"to the disciples","transliteration":"lil'ḥawāriyyīna","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"61:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنصَارِىٓ","en_gloss":"(are) my helper